Origin
- Concepts are derived from the author's private Agent Platform Next (design of a
  tamper-evident agent audit trail). No code, data or private content was copied.

Third-party material
- vectors/keys.json contains the Ed25519 test keys published in RFC 8032,
  section 7.1 (TEST 1 and TEST 2). They are public test values.
- Catalogue items paraphrase regulatory and standards texts with clause numbers:
  21 CFR Part 11 (US public domain); EudraLex Volume 4 Annex 11 (2011), its 2025
  revision draft, Chapter 4 draft and Annex 22 draft, and the EU GDP Guidelines
  2013/C 343/01 (European Union, reuse with acknowledgement); ISO 9001:2015 (clause
  numbers and titles only; paraphrases are the authors' own); ICH Q9(R1) and Q10;
  Regulation (EU) 2024/1689. Paraphrases are not the official texts.

Dependencies
- cryptography (Apache-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause), runtime.
- jsonschema (MIT), optional [schema] extra and tests.
- PyYAML (MIT), catalogue generator and tests only.
